---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import austinImage from "../assets/images/testimonials/jesus-loves-austin-unsplash-tiny.jpg";
import jeremyBoriack from "../assets/images/testimonials/jeremy-boriack.jpg";
import cruLogo from "../assets/images/testimonials/cru-logo-mono.png";
---

<section>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div
      class="py-12 md:py-20 border-t border-transparent dark:border-gray-800"
    >
      <!-- Section header -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center pb-10 md:pb-14">
        <h2
          class="h2 mb-4 font-red-hat-display"
          data-aos="fade-up"
        >
          Impacting ministries globally
        </h2>
        <p
          class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="100"
        >
          Churches and youth ministries run their services on TheOpenPresenter
          every week
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial -->
      <figure
        class="relative w-full mx-auto mb-12 md:mb-16 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 via-white to-teal-50/40 dark:from-gray-800 dark:via-gray-900 dark:to-gray-900 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/60 dark:shadow-none"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-400 to-purple-500"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-0 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)]">
          <div class="relative h-44 sm:h-56 md:h-full bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-900">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/45 via-black/10 to-transparent z-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="relative h-full overflow-hidden">
              <Image
                src={austinImage}
                alt="TheOpenPresenter used in a church setting"
                width={1200}
                height={1800}
                class="block w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="relative p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 lg:p-12">
            <svg
              class="absolute right-4 top-4 w-24 h-24 fill-current text-teal-500/[0.08] dark:text-teal-400/[0.08] pointer-events-none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path
                d="M10 8v6c0 3.3-2.7 6-6 6v-3c1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3H4V8h6zm10 0v6c0 3.3-2.7 6-6 6v-3c1.7 0 3-1.3 3-3h-3V8h6z"
              ></path>
            </svg>

            <blockquote class="relative space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              <p
                class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 font-medium"
              >
                I discovered TheOpenPresenter at just the right time. I was managing
                production for &ldquo;Fastbreak,&rdquo; a High School Ministry Winter
                Retreat with our Portland Metro High School Ministry. After
                encountering significant display connection and integration issues
                with other tools on our first night, I scrambled to find an
                alternative. That evening, I discovered TheOpenPresenter.
              </p>
              <p>
                Within a short time, I was able to build a skeleton for the
                remaining weekend sessions, import and format song lyrics, and
                generate scripture slides for our speakers. The standout feature was
                the ability to run the presentation from a cell phone, allowing me
                to hand off the controls easily and stay available for students.
              </p>
              <p>
                TheOpenPresenter has now become my go-to presentation tool for both
                our High School and Middle School ministries. It is user-friendly,
                flexible, and an excellent collaborative tool. It keeps our dynamic
                programs polished, allowing everyone to focus entirely on the
                content. Thank you to the dedicated community of developers
                contributing to this application. It is truly a gift.
              </p>
            </blockquote>

            <figcaption
              class="relative mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-800 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <div
                  class="shrink-0 rounded-full p-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-400 to-purple-500"
                >
                  <Image
                    src={jeremyBoriack}
                    alt="Jeremy Boriack"
                    width={64}
                    height={64}
                    class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full object-cover block border-2 border-white dark:border-gray-900"
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div
                    class="font-red-hat-display font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100"
                  >
                    Jeremy Boriack
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                    Cru High School, Portland Metro
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <Image
                src={cruLogo}
                alt="Cru"
                width={96}
                height={59}
                class="w-16 h-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 self-center sm:self-auto"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </figcaption>
          </div>
        </div>
      </figure>

      <!-- Open source / GitHub link -->
      <div
        class="mt-10 md:mt-12 flex justify-center"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        <a
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-teal-500 dark:hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors"
          href="https://github.com/Vija02/TheOpenPresenter"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 fill-current"
            viewBox="0 0 32 32"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path
              d="M16 8.2c-4.4 0-8 3.6-8 8 0 3.5 2.3 6.5 5.5 7.6.4.1.5-.2.5-.4V22c-2.2.5-2.7-1-2.7-1-.4-.9-.9-1.2-.9-1.2-.7-.5.1-.5.1-.5.8.1 1.2.8 1.2.8.7 1.3 1.9.9 2.3.7.1-.5.3-.9.5-1.1-1.8-.2-3.6-.9-3.6-4 0-.9.3-1.6.8-2.1-.1-.2-.4-1 .1-2.1 0 0 .7-.2 2.2.8.6-.2 1.3-.3 2-.3s1.4.1 2 .3c1.5-1 2.2-.8 2.2-.8.4 1.1.2 1.9.1 2.1.5.6.8 1.3.8 2.1 0 3.1-1.9 3.7-3.7 3.9.3.4.6.9.6 1.6v2.2c0 .2.1.5.6.4 3.2-1.1 5.5-4.1 5.5-7.6-.1-4.4-3.7-8-8.1-8z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          Open source on GitHub &middot; AGPL 3.0
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
